section.t:
Reject (one or more vectors per MUST), Alpha IDs:
J1/J2 duplicate member name; J3 unpaired surrogate; H1/H6 bare-hex
hash; H2/H7 uppercase-hex hash; H3/H8 unknown hash prefix; T3
lowercase "t"; T4 lowercase "z"; T7 "+00:00" offset; T6 fractional
seconds; T5 space instead of T; T8 seconds = 60; T9 invalid date
(2026-02-30); T10 non-ASCII digits (Arabic-Indic year digits);
P1 parents absent; P4 parents not an array; P2 parents entry not 64
lowercase ASCII hex (uppercase); P5 parents entry wrong length;
P6 parents entry with trailing newline; N1 hex-string signing;
N5 non-canonical S (S >= L); N6/N7 non-canonical A or R (y >= p);
N8 small-order A; N9 small-order R; J4 integer above 2^53-1
(9007199254740993); J5 overflow / non-finite (1e400); J7 underflow
of a non-zero literal (1e-400); N10 missing base64 padding; N11
embedded line break in signature; N12 trailing line break; N13
leading space; N14 trailing space; N15 URL-safe base64 characters;
N16 extra padding; N17 signature length 87; N18 signature length 89;
N19 non-canonical trailing bits (86th character Q to R).
